            {
              "id": "art-body",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "span": 9
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "In today’s competitive market, smart investments are what separate thriving companies from those just getting by. For businesses in the freight and logistics industry, the trucks in your fleet aren’t just assets—they’re the backbone of your operations. If you’re looking for a cost-effective way to expand, <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=used\">buying used semi trucks</a> might be the move that helps take your business to the next level. Here’s how <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=used\">used semi trucks</a> can help grow your business and why they’re a smart choice for companies looking to scale.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-roi",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Lower Upfront Investment, Higher ROI",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "roi"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-roi-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "One of the most noticeable benefits of purchasing <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=used\">used semi trucks</a> is the reduced cost. A new truck can run you well into six figures. Used models, on the other hand, offer significant savings while still delivering the performance you need to get the job done. Lower capital investment means more flexibility for your business. You can reinvest those savings into operations, driver training, marketing, or even adding more trucks to your fleet. Overall, used trucks can help you grow faster without compromising financial stability.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-flexibility",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Flexibility for Growing Fleets",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "flexibility"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-flexibility-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "<a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=used\">Used semi trucks</a> are perfect for businesses looking to test new markets or add capacity without a long-term financial commitment. Whether you’re expanding your delivery radius, taking on seasonal contracts, or launching a new branch, <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=used\">used trucks</a> give you the flexibility to scale at your own pace. You can buy one or several, depending on your current workload and ramp up when the time is right. <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=used\">Used trucks</a> make it easier to grow strategically, rather than taking on heavy debt just to stay competitive.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-insure",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Easier to Insure and Register",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "insure"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-insure-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "New vehicles often come with higher insurance premiums. Since <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=used\">used trucks</a> have a lower book value, your insurance costs may be more manageable, which is especially helpful when you’re expanding a fleet. In many cases, registration fees are also reduced, lowering your overall operating costs even further. When every dollar counts, these savings make a noticeable difference.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "pull-insure-2-row",
                  "type": "row",
                  "props": {
                    "gap": 0
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "pull-insure-2",
                      "type": "column",
                      "props": {
                        "span": 12
                      },
                      "styles": {
                        "base": {
                          "borderTopWidth": 1,
                          "borderBottomWidth": 1,
                          "borderLeftWidth": 0,
                          "borderRightWidth": 0,
                          "borderStyle": "solid",
                          "borderColor": "line",
                          "paddingTop": 24,
                          "paddingBottom": 24,
                          "marginTop": 28,
                          "marginBottom": 28
                        }
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "id": "pull-insure-2-text",
                          "type": "text",
                          "props": {
                            "text": "It’s about more than just purchase price—it’s the total cost of ownership that defines long-term profitability.",
                            "align": "left",
                            "width": "full"
                          },
                          "styles": {
                            "base": {
                              "fontSize": 22,
                              "fontWeight": "800",
                              "lineHeight": 1.4,
                              "textColor": "ink"
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-customize",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Customize Without the Premium Price Tag",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "customize"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-customize-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "One of the advantages of buying a <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=used\">used semi truck</a> is the flexibility it gives you to make upgrades without the steep upfront investment that comes with buying new. Since you’re saving significantly on the purchase price, there’s often more room in your budget to tailor the truck to your specific needs—whether that means installing improved lights, upgrading the sleeper cab, or adding advanced safety technology. <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=used\">Used trucks</a> provide a solid foundation for customization, allowing you to build a vehicle that fits your operation without paying top dollar for factory upgrades. It’s a smart way to get the features you want while keeping overall costs under control.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-durability",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Proven Durability You Can Trust",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "durability"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-durability-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Modern semi trucks are built to last. With regular maintenance and professional servicing, many models can stay on the road for hundreds of thousands of miles. When you <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=used\">buy a used truck</a> from a reputable dealer like <a href=\"/\">Sun State International</a>, you’re not just getting a secondhand vehicle—you’re getting a well-maintained machine with plenty of life left.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-durability-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Our <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=used\">used inventory</a> is thoroughly inspected and serviced by certified technicians. We carry trusted brands like <a href=\"https://www.international.com/\">International®</a>, and we stand behind the trucks we sell. When you drive off our lot, you’re not crossing your fingers—you’re moving forward with confidence.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-financing",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Financing That Works for You",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "financing"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-financing-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Choosing to purchase a <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=used\">used truck</a> isn’t the only way you can spend wisely. Working with a trusted partner that offers a <a href=\"/financing\">flexible financing plan</a> can also help you manage costs. That’s why at <a href=\"/\">Sun State International</a>, we offer flexible financing solutions designed to make acquiring <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=used\">used trucks</a> as straightforward as possible. Whether you’re a small operation or a growing logistics company, we’ll help you find a payment plan that works with your budget. Need help evaluating which truck is right for your route? Our team is here to answer your questions and help you find the best match for your needs—no pressure, just good guidance.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "co-financing-2-row",
                  "type": "row",
                  "props": {
                    "gap": 0
                  },
                  "children": [
