                },
                {
                  "id": "h-start",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Start Expanding Your Business Today",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "start"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-start-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "<a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=used\">Buying used semi trucks</a> is one of the most effective ways to grow your business without taking on unnecessary financial risk. With lower upfront costs, quicker turnaround, and long-term reliability, used trucks can deliver real value for your operation. At <a href=\"/\">Sun State International</a>, we make it easy to find high-quality used trucks that work as hard as you do. Visit our lot, talk to our team, and see how the right truck can help move your business forward. Ready to expand your fleet? <a href=\"/contact\">Contact Sun State International today</a> and ask about our available <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=used\">used semi trucks.</a>",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
